stions:1. Can you honestly help me.2? Can I completely trust you? 3. What percentage of the total amount in question will be good for you after the money is in your custody. Please, Consider this and get back to me as soon possible. Thank you so much and God bless you. My sincere regards, Miss Hussein Martin, ________________________________________________________________________Yahoo! India Matrimony: Find your life partner online to: http://yahoo.shaadi.com/india-matrimony",d01,Banking and Financial Services,"GENERAL SETTINGS
